  <para unique="1091623" format="xIndent1">
   <string>Non-EVEX-encoded instruction, see </string><link linkend="25627: 06_Table: Table 2-21. Type 4 Class Exception Conditions"><string>Table&#160;2&#8209;21, &#8220;Type 4 Class Exception Conditions.&#8221;</string></link></para>
